{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Always Allow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Always Allow" } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "常に許可" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "始终允许" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一律允許" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一律允許" } }
      }
    },
    "Always allowed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Always allowed" } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "常に許可" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "始终允许" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一律允許" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一律允許" } }
      }
    },
    "Choose Always Allow when an app asks to sign. It can sign whenever this vault is unlocked, including after you lock and open it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Choose Always Allow when an app asks to sign. It can sign whenever this vault is unlocked, including after you lock and open it again." } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "署名を求められたときに「常に許可」を選べます。保管庫が開いているあいだはそのアプリが署名でき、ロックして開き直したあとも同じです。" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "app 来要求签名时可以选择「始终允许」。只要这份保险库是解锁的，它就可以签名，包括上锁后再打开。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "app 來要求簽名時可以選擇「一律允許」。只要這份保險庫是解鎖的，它就可以簽名，包括上鎖後再打開。" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "app 來要求簽名時可以選擇「一律允許」。只要這部保險庫是解鎖的，它就可以簽名，包括上鎖後再打開。" } }
      }
    },
    "Match logins to the open website" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Match logins to the open website" } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "開いているウェブサイトにログインを合わせる" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "按当前网站匹配登录" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "依開啟的網站對應登入" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "依開啟的網站對應登入" } }
      }
    },
    "Open website" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open website" } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "開いているウェブサイト" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "当前网站" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "開啟的網站" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "開啟的網站" } }
      }
    },
    "Off until you turn it on. The menu bar and the command palette can then read the address of the front browser tab and put that site's logins first. Only an http or https address is kept. The page is not read, and nothing in the browser is clicked or changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Off until you turn it on. The menu bar and the command palette can then read the address of the front browser tab and put that site's logins first. Only an http or https address is kept. The page is not read, and nothing in the browser is clicked or changed." } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "オフのままです。オンにすると、メニューバーとコマンドパレットが前面のブラウザタブのアドレスを読み、そのサイトのログインを先に出します。使うのは http または https のアドレスだけです。ページは読まず、ブラウザ内のクリックや変更もしません。" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "默认关闭。打开后，菜单栏和命令面板会读取浏览器最前面分页的网址，把这个网站的登录排在前面。只保留 http 或 https 地址。不会读取网页，也不会在浏览器里点击或更改任何内容。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "預設關閉。開啟後，選單列和指令面板會讀取瀏覽器最前面分頁的網址，把這個網站的登入排在前面。只保留 http 或 https 網址。不會讀取網頁，也不會在瀏覽器裡點按或更改任何內容。" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "預設關閉。開啟後，選單列和指令面板會讀取瀏覽器最前面分頁的網址，把這個網站的登入排在前面。只保留 http 或 https 網址。不會讀取網頁，也不會在瀏覽器裡點按或更改任何內容。" } }
      }
    },
    "Turning this on does not grant access by itself. The next time the menu bar or command palette opens over a browser, macOS asks to let Triwarden control that browser. The system says this Automation permission can reach documents and data and perform actions there. That describes the permission, which is broader than this request. Triwarden asks one question: the address of the front tab. Each browser asks once. Don't Allow leaves the rest of Triwarden working; that browser's tab is not matched. Turning this off stops the question. To remove a permission already given, use System Settings › Privacy & Security › Automation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Turning this on does not grant access by itself. The next time the menu bar or command palette opens over a browser, macOS asks to let Triwarden control that browser. The system says this Automation permission can reach documents and data and perform actions there. That describes the permission, which is broader than this request. Triwarden asks one question: the address of the front tab. Each browser asks once. Don't Allow leaves the rest of Triwarden working; that browser's tab is not matched. Turning this off stops the question. To remove a permission already given, use System Settings › Privacy & Security › Automation." } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "スイッチを入れただけでは許可になりません。次にブラウザの手前でメニューバーかコマンドパレットを開くと、macOS が Triwarden にそのブラウザの制御を許可するか尋ねます。システムは、この「オートメーション」権限で書類やデータにアクセスし、操作を実行できると表示します。それは権限そのものの説明で、今回のリクエストより広い範囲です。Triwarden が聞くのは前面のタブのアドレスだけです。ブラウザごとに一度だけ尋ねます。「許可しない」を選んでも他の機能はそのままで、そのブラウザのタブは照合されません。スイッチを切ると質問は止まります。すでに許可した権限を外すには「システム設定 › プライバシーとセキュリティ › オートメーション」を使います。" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "打开开关本身不会授权。下次在浏览器前面打开菜单栏或命令面板时，macOS 会询问是否允许 Triwarden 控制该浏览器。系统会说这项“自动化”权限可以访问浏览器里的文稿和数据，并在其中执行操作。那是系统对这项权限的说明，比这次请求更广。Triwarden 只问一个问题：最前面分页的网址。每个浏览器只问一次。选择“不允许”不影响其他功能，只是不会匹配该浏览器的分页。关闭开关后就不再询问。若要移除已经允许的权限，请到“系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 自动化”。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "打開開關本身不會授權。下次在瀏覽器前面打開選單列或指令面板時，macOS 會詢問是否允許 Triwarden 控制該瀏覽器。系統會說這項「自動化」權限可以取用瀏覽器裡的文稿和資料，並在其中執行動作。那是系統對這項權限的說明，比這次請求更廣。Triwarden 只問一個問題：最前面分頁的網址。每個瀏覽器只問一次。選擇「不允許」不影響其他功能，只是不會對應該瀏覽器的分頁。關閉開關後就不再詢問。若要移除已經允許的權限，請到「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 自動化」。" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "打開開關本身不會授權。下次在瀏覽器前面打開選單列或指令面板時，macOS 會詢問是否允許 Triwarden 控制該瀏覽器。系統會說這項「自動化」權限可以取用瀏覽器裡的文稿和資料，並在其中執行動作。那是系統對這項權限的說明，比這次請求更廣。Triwarden 只問一個問題：最前面分頁的網址。每個瀏覽器只問一次。選擇「不允許」不影響其他功能，只是不會對應該瀏覽器的分頁。關閉開關後就不再詢問。若要移除已經允許的權限，請到「系統設定 › 私隱與保安 › 自動化」。" } }
      }
    },
    "Match %@'s front tab?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Match %1$@'s front tab?" } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$@ の前面のタブに合わせますか？" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "要读取 %1$@ 最前面的分页吗？" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "要讀取 %1$@ 最前面的分頁嗎？" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "要讀取 %1$@ 最前面的分頁嗎？" } }
      }
    },
    "Triwarden can read the address of %@'s front tab so that site's logins come first. macOS will ask to let Triwarden control the browser. Automation can reach documents and perform actions; Triwarden only asks for the front tab's http or https address. It does not read the page or change the browser." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Triwarden can read the address of %1$@'s front tab so that site's logins come first. macOS will ask to let Triwarden control the browser. Automation can reach documents and perform actions; Triwarden only asks for the front tab's http or https address. It does not read the page or change the browser." } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Triwarden は %1$@ の前面のタブのアドレスを読み、そのサイトのログインを先に出せます。macOS は Triwarden にブラウザの制御を許可するか尋ねます。「オートメーション」は書類へのアクセスや操作ができます。Triwarden が聞くのは前面のタブの http または https のアドレスだけです。ページは読まず、ブラウザも変更しません。" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Triwarden 可以读取 %1$@ 最前面分页的网址，把这个网站的登录排在前面。macOS 会询问是否允许 Triwarden 控制该浏览器。“自动化”可以访问文稿并执行操作；Triwarden 只询问最前面分页的 http 或 https 网址。它不会读取网页，也不会更改浏览器。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Triwarden 可以讀取 %1$@ 最前面分頁的網址，把這個網站的登入排在前面。macOS 會詢問是否允許 Triwarden 控制該瀏覽器。「自動化」可以取用文稿並執行動作；Triwarden 只詢問最前面分頁的 http 或 https 網址。它不會讀取網頁，也不會更改瀏覽器。" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Triwarden 可以讀取 %1$@ 最前面分頁的網址，把這個網站的登入排在前面。macOS 會詢問是否允許 Triwarden 控制該瀏覽器。「自動化」可以取用文稿並執行動作；Triwarden 只詢問最前面分頁的 http 或 https 網址。它不會讀取網頁，也不會更改瀏覽器。" } }
      }
    },
    "%@ wants to sign" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$@ wants to sign" } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$@ が署名しようとしています" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$@ 想要签名" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$@ 想要簽名" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$@ 想要簽名" } }
      }
    },
    "via %@ · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "via %1$@ · %2$@" } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$@ 経由 · %2$@" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "经由 %1$@ · %2$@" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "經由 %1$@ · %2$@" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "經由 %1$@ · %2$@" } }
      }
    },
    "This signs one SSH operation. The private key stays in your vault." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This signs one SSH operation. The private key stays in your vault." } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "SSH の署名を 1 回行います。秘密鍵は保管庫に残ります。" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "这次只做一次 SSH 签名。私钥留在保险库里。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "這次只做一次 SSH 簽名。私鑰留在保險庫裡。" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "這次只做一次 SSH 簽名。私鑰留在保險庫裡。" } }
      }
    },
    "This app has asked to sign before." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This app has asked to sign before." } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "このアプリは以前にも署名を求めています。" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "这个 app 先前来要过签名。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "這個 app 先前來要過簽名。" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "這個 app 先前來要過簽名。" } }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask for Touch ID or your Mac login password. That password stays with macOS." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "macOS will ask for Touch ID or your Mac login password. That password stays with macOS." } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "続いて macOS が Touch ID またはこの Mac のログインパスワードを求めます。そのパスワードは macOS だけが扱います。" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "macOS 接着会要求 Touch ID 或这台 Mac 的登录密码。这组密码只留在 macOS。" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "macOS 接著會要求 Touch ID 或這台 Mac 的登入密碼。這組密碼只留在 macOS。" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "macOS 接著會要求 Touch ID 或這部 Mac 的登入密碼。這組密碼只留在 macOS。" } }
      }
    },
    "Allow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Allow" } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "許可" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "允许" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "允許" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "允許" } }
      }
    },
    "How long to allow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "How long to allow" } },
        "ja" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "許可する期間" } },
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "允许多久" } },
        "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "允許多久" } },
        "zh-HK" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "允許多久" } }
      }
    },
    "Allow Once" : {
